flowchart TD
    %% ---------- Inputs ----------
    Player([👤 Player]) -->|types a guess| UI[Streamlit UI<br/>app.py]
    Player -->|clicks 'Ask the coach'| UI
    Dev([🧑‍💻 Developer]) -->|python coach_cli.py| CLI[Coach CLI<br/>coach_cli.py]

    %% ---------- Game ----------
    UI -->|valid guess| Logic[Game logic<br/>logic_utils.py<br/>parse_guess · check_guess · update_score]
    Logic -->|Too High / Too Low / Win| Feedback[(Hint history<br/>guess, outcome pairs)]

    %% ---------- Agent ----------
    Feedback -->|GameState: range, hints,<br/>attempts left — NO secret| Agent
    CLI -->|GameState| Agent

    subgraph Agent[AI Coach agent — coach/agent.py]
        direction TB
        Plan[1. PLAN<br/>compute feasible interval] -->|interval empty| Glitch[🐛 Report glitch:<br/>hints contradict]
        Plan -->|interval ok| Act[2. ACT<br/>ask model for a guess]
        Act --> Check{3. CHECK<br/>validator.py}
        Check -->|rejected + reason<br/>tries left| Act
        Check -->|rejected 3×<br/>or model error| Fallback[4. GUARD<br/>binary-search midpoint]
        Check -->|accepted| Accept[✅ Verified suggestion]
    end

    Act <-->|prompt + rejection feedback /<br/>JSON guess, reasoning, confidence| Models

    subgraph Models[Model backends — coach/models.py]
        Claude[ClaudeCoachModel<br/>Claude API, JSON schema output]
        Offline[OfflineCoachModel<br/>rules-based, no key needed]
        Chaos[ChaosCoachModel<br/>fault injection for testing]
    end

    %% ---------- Outputs ----------
    Accept --> Out[Suggestion + reasoning +<br/>confidence + agent trace]
    Fallback --> Out
    Glitch --> Out
    Out -->|shown in UI / CLI| Player
    Out -->|'Play' button| Logic

    Agent -.->|every step| Log[(logs/coach.log)]

    %% ---------- Testing & human review ----------
    subgraph QA[Testing and evaluation]
        Pytest[pytest<br/>tests/ — 52 tests]
        Eval[evaluate.py<br/>full games: offline · chaos · glitched · claude]
        Reports[(reports/*.json)]
        Eval --> Reports
    end
    Pytest -.->|unit + integration checks| Agent
    Eval -.->|plays complete games| Agent
    Reports -->|human review| Dev
    Log -->|human audit| Dev
